## Acceptance criteria

- [ ] Pause starts no new issue or review work but lets current operations settle.
- [ ] Stop cancels only owned work and preserves recovery artifacts.
- [ ] Restart produces a recovery summary and waits for explicit resume.
- [ ] A ref advance followed by a crash is not repeated, and uncertain validation is not treated as passed.
- [ ] Retry/review counters and approvals survive restart unchanged.
- [ ] Plugin exit does not leave an independent orchestrator or dashboard running.
- [ ] This slice's behavioral regression tests pass: `bun test tests/integration/14-recovery.test.ts`.
- [ ] Type checking and lint pass; no unsupported platform is silently excluded.
- [ ] The demonstrable flow below works through the public command/adapter boundary.

